‍नीम।"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["मिनु मेको रे पा लाइबपुकीमी “गे परमप्रभु यावे आ आसीक रावो। परमप्रभु यावे आ नेंम इ कली आसीक गेनीकी” मदेंनीम। रूथ २:४"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/suz_wbt/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/suz_wbt/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/suz_wbt/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}